WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=yo.

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.762
Nigbamii, tẹsiwaju lati wo ẹhin oju.

2
00:00:04.762 --> 00:00:10.928
Mu ophthalmoscope ni ọwọ ọtun rẹ lati ṣayẹwo oju ọtun ati ni idakeji.

3
00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:15.450
Bẹrẹ pẹlu ẹsẹ rẹ sunmo alaisan ki o tẹ sẹhin.

4
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.972
Beere lọwọ alaisan lati ṣatunṣe lori ibi-afẹde ijinna kan pato lori

5
00:00:19.972 --> 00:00:24.494
petele ati yago fun wiwo ina ti ophthalmoscope.

6
00:00:24.494 --> 00:00:32.305
Laiyara bẹrẹ lati gbe wọle lati iwọn 10 si 15 fun igba diẹ lori meridian petele pẹlu lẹnsi agbara odo.

7
00:00:32.305 --> 00:00:37.238
Jeki ifasilẹ pupa ni wiwo ki o si sunmọ alaisan naa.

8
00:00:37.238 --> 00:00:41.760
Disiki opiki yẹ ki o wa si wiwo nigbati o kọ lati

9
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.418
sẹntimita kuro.

10
00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:46.040
Ọrọìwòye lori bawo ni pato ala ti disiki jẹ, awọn

11
00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:51.002
awọ ti neuro-retinal rim ati ife si ipin disiki.

12
00:00:51.002 --> 00:00:53.980
Ti o ko ba le wo disiki naa,

13
00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:57.460
lẹhinna gbe lọ si itọsọna ti awọn ẹka ti aaye oju-omi oju-iwe retina.

14
00:00:57.460 --> 00:01:00.905
Eyi yoo tọ ọ lọ si ọna disiki naa.

15
00:01:00.905 --> 00:01:04.350
Ninu idanwo yii iṣan opiki jẹ

16
00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:04.659
wú.

17
00:01:04.659 --> 00:01:08.670
Awọn ala ti wa ni indistinct ati awọn aringbungbun ago ko si nitori jije

18
00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.941
kún nipasẹ awọn agbegbe wiwu nafu.

19
00:01:10.941 --> 00:01:13.590
Awọn itanran capillaries lori dada ti

20
00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:17.192
nafu ara ti o ṣipaya, gẹgẹbi diẹ ninu awọn iṣọn-ẹjẹ nla.

21
00:01:17.192 --> 00:01:18.830
Awọn iṣọn ti wa ni wiwu ati

22
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.620
isun ẹjẹ kekere kan wa ni aago mẹsan.

23
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.790
Gbogbo awọn ami wọnyi ni ibamu pẹlu papillodema

24
00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:27.783
nitori titẹ intracranial ti o ga.

25
00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:34.970
Nafu ara opiki yii ni ala ti o yatọ pupọ diẹ sii,

26
00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:40.948
ṣugbọn awọn neuroretinal rim jẹ tan kaakiri bia.

27
00:01:40.948 --> 00:01:46.072
Eyi ni irisi optocatrophe.

28
00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.780
Ninu eyi

29
00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:51.689
ayewo ago aarin ti wa ni gbooro pẹlu tinrin ti awọn neuroretinal rim.

30
00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:52.340
Nafu ara

31
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:57.540
Nitoribẹẹ ni ife ti o tobi si ipin disiki ti 0.8, ni iyanju pupọ ti wiwa ti

32
00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:57.980
glaucoma.
